# Inserra CRM marketing + developer docs.
#
# /crm/* on inserra.ai is transparently proxied to the inserra-marketing
# Netlify deployment. The browser URL stays at inserra.ai/crm/..., Netlify
# fetches the response from the marketing project under the hood. No
# code change here — your existing company page at / keeps working.
#
# Status 200 (not 301/302) keeps the URL bar unchanged and treats this
# as a server-side rewrite, not a redirect.
/crm/*  https://inserra-marketing.netlify.app/crm/:splat  200
